resources.string:
"About Creating Activity

Tap [Create] on the [Room Activity] page. Select the activity, the start time and duration of the activity, enter your activity slogan, and then tap [Create] at the bottom of the page.
Once the activity is created successfully, you can't delete or change it until it ends. Therefore please make sure to fill out the correct information when creating.

You may not be able to create an activity in the following cases:
1. Your network connection is unstable;
2. You have created an activity and can't create another one before the previous one ends;
3. The activity you select is unavailable now and please select other activities;
4. You're banned from chat in chatrooms;
5. The activity you select is an official activity, which can't be created by users."

"About Activity Display

The activity created will be displayed in the following places:
1. The [MINE] page;
2. Room list on the activity page (only rooms reaching level 10 will be displayed);
3. Activity announcement in the chatroom.

Note: if you're banned from chatting in chatrooms due to violations, your room activity will be stopped and you can't create a new activity during the punishment."

"2. Task Rewards:
\"Club Points\" will be automatically issued after completing the task;
\"Club Points Bonus\" will take effect on Saturday at 6:00 (GMT+3) after completing the task, lasting 24 hours. During this period, you can enjoy the corresponding multiplier on Club Points earned from tasks."

"Dear user, the system has detected an initiated refund or abnormal gold/diamond income from this account. The related refund amount/abnormal income, {XXX} golds {YYY} diamonds, has been deducted from your current balance and your account is frozen. Your account will be unfrozen automatically once you pay off all debts. Tap here to view debt details. 
Pay off the debts to unfreeze the account and lift the following restrictions:
1. Unable to use golds and diamonds;
2. Unable to modify the name, bio, and profile photo;
3. Unable to add friends or chat with friends;
4. Unable to spectate games;
5. Unable to match players in online games;
6. Unable to enter the chat rooms;
7. Your own chat room will be closed."

"The system will determine the account identity based on user devices and account information, etc. Your application will be more likely to pass when you use the following methods: 
1. Submit the application on a usual device or a device once used for login; 
2. Submit the application under a Wi-Fi network that has been used before, such as your home or office network."

"If you fail to redeem an item, please verify:
1. You have sufficient Fortune Coins;
2. You haven't exceeded the monthly redemption limit for that item (most items are limited monthly);
3. You don't own the item;
4. You are Royal user;
5. Your network connection is stable.
If you still failed to redeem, please contact our customer service for assistance."
